description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests searching, explaining, or deriving
  case/issue context for XTI threat intelligence in three read-only modes: DISCOVER
  broadly when no single object is named yet (search/find/list indicators or relationships),
  EXPLAIN one already-named threat object (a threat actor, malware family, or campaign)
  and its relationships, and CASE/ISSUE CONTEXT derives the threat-intel context for
  a Cortex case or issue (indicator relevance, related actors or malware, prioritization,
  next steps) via XQL joins over issue_to_indicator and the XTI datasets. Examples:
  "search for indicators related to this actor", "explain this malware family", "what
  is the TI context for my phishing case". This skill is read-only. Do not activate
  for changing/updating an existing indicator, standalone single-indicator enrichment,
  external report ingestion from a URL, or ticketing, messaging, and bulk/upsert indicator
  writes.'
